Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有庆祝活动吗  人们如何迎接新年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is there any entertainment there? What are people doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来喽  1999年  乔伊"快乐"的一年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Here we go. 1999, the year of Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.01,0:00:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're very happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.76,0:00:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想在午夜接吻  但其他人都没这个打算\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We wanted to kiss at midnight, but nobody else is going to so, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.97,0:00:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  交给我吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'll take care of it. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,33  32  31  罗斯  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thirty-three, 32, 31. Ross, Ross, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你零点要亲谁  瑞秋还是菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, who are you kissing at midnight? Rachel or Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你得亲人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Well, you gotta kiss someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能亲你妹  那谁要亲我妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't kiss your sister. Who's gonn但a kiss my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.86,0:00:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  老兄  不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler. Oh, man. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得谁比较好  我还是钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who would you rather have kiss your sister? Me or Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着有道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a good point. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.91,0:00:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟瑞秋谈过恋爱  那就菲比吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, since I have that whole history with Rachel, I guess Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  菲比  菲比  罗斯午夜零点想亲你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, great. Pheebs, Pheebs. Listen. Ross wants to kiss you at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太明显了  他干嘛不直接问我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So obvious. Why doesn't he just ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我午夜零点要亲你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rash, Rash. Listen, I'm going to kiss you at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.25,0:00:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你不能亲罗斯  这样会小尴尬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You can't kiss Ross. You got the history.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So? So?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.43,0:00:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我亲还是让钱德亲  问得好  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you prefer me or Chandler? Oh, good point.Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:01:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,3  2  1\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新年快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.98,0:01:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新年快乐  新年快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy New Year. Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.03,0:01:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  新年快乐  你也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy New Year, Pheebs. You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  新年快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy New Year, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那个吻如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that do anything for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第11集  新年新气象\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E11 The One With All The Resolutions
