Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.25,0:01:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要召告天下  "99年我不离婚"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to go out on a limb and say, "No divorces in '99."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你的离婚手续还没办好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But your divorce isn't even final yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,99年我只离一次婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just the one divorce in '99.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道吗  我今年要过得很快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I'm gonna be happy this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要让自己快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna make myself happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我们回避吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want us to leave the room or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我每天  都要做一件没做过的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Every day, I am going to do one thing I have never done before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我的新年新希望\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That, my friends, is my New Year's resolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.73,0:02:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好棒的希望  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh. That's a good one. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想开大型客机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mine is to pilot a commercial jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.78,0:02:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个也很棒  接着你得找一群\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a good one too. Now you only have to find a planeload of people...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.99,0:02:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己坠机身亡的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...whose resolution is to plummet to their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你应该立志不取笑朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe your resolution should be not to make fun of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是会免费搭你去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Especially the ones who may soon be flying you to Europe for free...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欧洲的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...on their own plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她开飞机的机率\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She has a better chance of sprouting wings and flying up your nose...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比你不取笑我们还高\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...than you do of not making fun of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.09,0:03:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,50元  我赌你无法一年不取笑我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, I'll bet you 50 bucks you can't go the whole year without making fun of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.93,0:03:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样  干脆一星期好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? Better yet, a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.89,0:03:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我赌了  朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll take that bet, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不  输我那50元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you know what? Paying me the 50 bucks can be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就可以当你的"每日新鲜事"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the "new thing you do" that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就从现在开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it starts right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的新年新希望是学吉他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, my New Year's resolution is to learn how to play guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? How come? Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的履历表  不是列了一堆特殊专长嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know those special skills I have listed on my resume?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望有一项是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I would love it if one of those was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我教你吗  我是个很好的老师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want me to teach you? I'm a great teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  你教过谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Who have you taught?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我教过我  我很喜欢我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I taught me and I loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.59,0:03:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  谢谢你  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That'd be great. Yeah, thanks, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱儿忘了把眼镜带走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, look. Blaire forgot her glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她需要这副眼镜来盯住男朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's gonna be needing these to keep an eye on that boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁  我听说他得把订书机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who, from what I hear, needs to keep his stapler...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收在收屉里  你们懂我的意思吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in his desk drawer, if you know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你应该让自己别那么八卦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach, maybe your resolution should be to, urn, gossip less.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哪有那么八卦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I don't gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我偶尔会发现一些事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe sometimes I find out things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或听到一些事  然后转述出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or I hear something and I pass that information on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当做一种服务\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, kind of like a public service.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这并不代表我很八卦  你们会说新闻主播八卦吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Doesn't mean I'm a gossip. I mean, would you call Ted Koppel a gossip?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他说同事隆胸失败的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if Ted Koppel talked about his coworkers' botched boob jobs...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...yeah, I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她隆成这样啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, they were like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就明天见  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll see you tomorrow. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:34.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我约刚才那个女生出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just asked that girl out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮  漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice. Nice. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这算是你今天的"新鲜事"吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that part of your resolution, your "new thing" for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.61,0:04:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  你们看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, it is. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白…\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Elizabeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.03,0:04:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宏史歪哥"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Hornswoggle"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白宏史歪哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Elizabeth Hornswoggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宏史歪哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hornswoggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗  钱德  这个姓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You okay, Chandler? ls there something--?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个姓有哪里好笑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Something funny about that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我只是觉得在哪里好像听过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, I just think that maybe I've heard it somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  真的  在哪里听过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, really? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定是个很好笑的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Somewhere funny I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  菲比  猜猜  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs. Guess what? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟一个叫伊丽莎白 宏史歪哥的约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, I have a date with, uh, Elizabeth Hornswoggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宏史歪哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hornswoggle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的嘴一定很痒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, this must be killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  待会见  回见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, see you later. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我可以上第一课了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, Pheebs, I am ready for my first lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  不行  不能碰吉他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Oh, no, no, you don't touch the guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  先练手  再练琴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. First you learn here, then you learn here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  第一课  和弦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Lesson One: Chords. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这些和弦的真正名称\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, um, I don't know the actual names of the chords, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.06,0:05:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我照手势帮它们取了名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I made up names for the way my hand looks while I'm doing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  这是"熊爪"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So then, this is "Bear Claw."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"火鸡脚"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, "Turkey Leg"...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和"老太太"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and "om Lady."
