Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我遇到天大的问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Joey, I have such a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来得正好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, your timing couldn't be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在到处救火\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm putting out fires all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:19.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  乔伊  我得告诉你一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay. Joey, I have got to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is it? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  这件事太大条了  但你得保证  不能说出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. It's so huge. But you have to promise me, you cannot tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不要  我不想知道  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. I don't want to know. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  你绝对想知道  太不可思议了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes, yes. You do want to know. This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不管  我不想再当  知道所有秘密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't care, Rach. Look, I'm tired of being the guy who knows all the secrets...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.89,0:15:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却不能说的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and can't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么秘密  你知道什么秘密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know secrets? What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该八卦的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you're not supposed to be gossiping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  但这件事我怕藏不住  我刚才拿起电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I know, I can't keep this in. So I pick upthe phone--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not listening to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你进去很久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You've been in there for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我开始有点害怕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm starting to get kind of freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我要出去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'm coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.01,0:16:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把灯关掉吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, can you turn the lights off?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  灯就让它开着吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Let's just leave the lights on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我出了一点状况\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.33,0:16:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能跟你说话  我又没在电话簿上登过广告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I can't talk to you. I don't have a fancy ad in the yellow pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你听我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:17:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为批评你的教学法道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to apologize for saying your method was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.98,0:17:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想重新拜你为师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And maybe, ask you to be my teacher again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证  在你说可以之前  绝对不碰吉他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I promise, I won't touch a guitar until you say I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的可以了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You really think I'm ready? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  酷毙了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Key-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.52,0:17:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个和弦弹对了吗  不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was the chord at least right before--? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们听说了  好惨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We heard about your pants. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,照理说今年应该很美好才对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This year was supposed to be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才第二天  我就成了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's only the second day, and I'm a loser...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿不合身皮裤的衰人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with stupid leather pants that don't even fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没这回事 你不衰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.51,0:18:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, look. Look, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班画了你的画像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ben drew a picture of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是牛仔喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh? You're a cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.69,0:18:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我穿皮裤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because of the leather pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.49,0:18:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班并不觉得你衰  他觉得你是牛仔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ben doesn't think you're a loser. He thinks you're a cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很棒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, that's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很棒  牛仔哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It really is something. Howdy, partner. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我应该再去买一条\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe I should get another pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有一些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, you know, they had some...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,侧边有流苏的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with fringe all down the sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.55,0:19:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去跟班说晚安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go kiss Ben good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他居然觉得我是牛仔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe he thinks I'm a cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会是个好牛仔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I would make a good cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  既然没事  我要去洗衣服了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now that everything's wrapped up here, I'm gonna go do my laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也去  如果这一件脏了的话  脏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, me too. You know, if this shirt is dirty. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm gonna go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去机场  只要等久一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go to the airport. If I hang around there long enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该能逮到没人管的飞机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...someone's bound to leave one of those planes unattended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good luck, honey. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  记得我要给你说的那件大事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, uh, Joey, remember that big thing I was going to tell you about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会告诉你  但如果你自己发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not gonna tell you. But if you found out on your own...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:20:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就没关系了  我们就可以讨论了  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that would be okay, and then we could talk about it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样就不是秘密  的确没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then it wouldn't be a secret. So, yeah, that would be okay. Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.29,0:20:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  乔伊  你去钱德的房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joe, would you mind going over into Chandler's bedroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把我借给他的书拿回来好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and getting that book back that he borrowed from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  你要我现在去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now? You want me to go over there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道了什么吗  你知道了什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know something? Do you know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我或许知道了  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I might know something. I might too something too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道了什么  你先说我才能说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the thing you know? You tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.77,0:20:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能说  那我也不能说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't tell you. Then I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.39,0:20:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.11,0:20:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不如我现在就去钱德的房间  就可以知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about I go there and walk into Chandler's bedroom and see the thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想的确实没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that I think I know is actually the thing I think I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.25,0:20:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  你也知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know. And you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德和摩妮卡  真叫人不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler and Monica? Oh, this is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道多久了  太久了  天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How long have you known? Too long. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我早就想找人说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, I've been dying to talk to someone about this for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们不能告诉别人  他们两个好紧张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, listen. You can't say anything to anybody. They're so weird about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen. Hey, Phoebe. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.06,0:21:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在下雨  我不想在下雨天飞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's raining. I don't like to fly in the rain so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去雨中漫步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I am going to go for a walk in the rain. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.07,0:21:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.87,0:21:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定有一腿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I bet they're doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我藏不住了  受不了了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good. Okay, look. I can't take it anymore. I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了  好吗  拿去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you win. Okay? Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.68,0:21:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  开飞机  不如开太空船\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs? Flying a jet? Better make it a spaceship...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.34,0:21:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回你的星球去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so you can get back to your home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  有你的电话  汤姆琼斯跟你要他的裤子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Ross. Phone call for you today. Tom Jones. He wants his pants back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:22:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宏史歪哥  什么  你在跟卡通人物约会吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Hornswoggle? What, are you dating a character from Fraggle Rock?
